# Campamento Pokémon — Implementation Plan

A full-stack, role-based Pokémon web app combining a Pokédex, Team Builder, and Item Shop. Built on React + Vite, Firebase (Auth + Firestore), and PokéAPI. Deployed statically to GitHub Pages.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Firebase credentials**: You must provide your own Firebase project credentials. I will create a `.env` file template (`.env.example`) with the required variable names. You fill it in with real values before running or deploying.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **GitHub Pages base path**: I will configure Vite's `base` to `/campamento-pokemon/`. If your repo or GitHub Pages URL uses a different path, let me know before deployment.

> [!WARNING]
> **Admin role**: Admin status is determined by a Firestore `users` document field `role: "admin"`. After creating an account, you must manually set this field in the Firebase console for the admin user. There is no self-promotion UI by design.

---

